# `tan doctor` support bundles. Written into the repo root by design, but they
# snapshot the DEVELOPER's machine -- one already carried a literal
# `C:\Users\<name>` home path. This is a public repo; they must never be
# committable by a stray `git add -A`.
/.alp-support/
